IRON_HOMEOSTASIS	Provisional iron signaling panel	TFRC	SLC40A1	FTH1	FTL	SLC11A2	HAMP
STROMAL_ECM	Provisional stromal ECM remodeling panel	COL1A1	COL1A2	COL3A1	MMP2	MMP9	TIMP1	DCN	FN1	LUM
INFLAMMATORY	Provisional immune/inflammatory response panel	IL6	CXCL8	CXCL12	STAT3	NFKB1	PTGS2	CCL2
SENESCENCE_SASP	Provisional senescence/SASP panel	CDKN1A	CDKN2A	SERPINE1	IL6	CXCL8	MMP3	DIO2
OXIDATIVE_STRESS	Provisional oxidative stress panel	HMOX1	NQO1	GPX1	SOD2	GCLC	GCLM	NFE2L2
