HYPOXIA	Provisional hypoxia panel	HIF1A	VEGFA	CA9	LDHA	SLC2A1	PDK1	EGLN1
TGF_BETA	Provisional TGF-beta signaling panel	TGFB1	TGFB2	TGFBR1	TGFBR2	SMAD2	SMAD3	SERPINE1	CTGF
PI3K_AKT	Provisional PI3K-AKT panel	AKT1	AKT2	PIK3CA	PIK3R1	MTOR	PTEN	FOXO1	GSK3B
STEM_CELL_MARKERS	Provisional endometrial stem/stromal markers	CD44	SUSD2	THY1	MCAM	NT5E	SOX2	KLF4
RECEPTIVITY	Provisional endometrial receptivity panel	PAEP	SPP1	LIF	HOXA10	HOXA11	MUC1	ITGAV	ITGB3
